meta-yaqoud-ivi is a Yocto layer for the Yaqoud IVI image and related package recipes.

Dependencies
============

This layer depends on:

  core
  flutter-layer
  virtualization-layer

It is compatible with the scarthgap release series.

Adding the layer
=================

Add the layer to your build with:

  bitbake-layers add-layer meta-yaqoud-ivi
